{"1794240": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "SysAdmin Odyssey - Back to the office", "steam_appid": 1794240, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "dlc": [4693480], "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The system administrator simulator is a sandbox in which you can try on the role of a system administrator in offices of different types and sizes and even remotely!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every new game day you will face different tasks and problems in the office where you work. Scared users will come running to you and tell you that their keyboard is not working and the printer has stopped printing. Will you be able to solve all the problems effectively, or will you accumulate a lot of debts on tasks and violate the SLA? Or maybe you will be able to teach users how to solve their own minor problems, while you drink coffee at home? It all depends on you!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1794240/extras/586cd81c8bc674616651805684664043.webp?t=1783907866\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1794240/extras/586cd81c8bc674616651805684664043.poster.avif?t=1783907866\" class=\"bb_img\" width=1170 height=658 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1794240/extras/462daf96adea0885806626ecca4ce304.poster.avif?t=1783907866\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1794240/extras/462daf96adea0885806626ecca4ce304.webm?t=1783907866\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1794240/extras/462daf96adea0885806626ecca4ce304.mp4?t=1783907866\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\